# Shared flags of the fixture-cache replay program (`testkit.FixtureCompileCache`), which
# `tools/fixture-cache.sh` and `devkit.FixtureCache` build into a cache entry of their own:
# they pass `-js <entry>` themselves, so the output line cannot live here (haxe rejects a
# second `-js`). `tools/fixture-cache.hxml` is the leaf the compiler oracle typechecks.
#
# No `-cp src` and no `-lib utest`: the replay program is `test/testkit` code alone, so an
# import an ambient source under `test/` adds has to resolve without either.
-cp test
-main testkit.FixtureCompileCache
-lib hxnodejs
-D js-es=6
